							and limitations described below.
						</p>

						<div class="summary-points">
							<span>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
									<path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path>
								</svg>
								No account or subscription required
							</span>
							<span>
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
