							<h2>Using this website</h2>
							<p>By accessing or using Universal Age Calculator, you agree to use the website in accordance with these Terms of Use. If you do not agree with these terms, you should not use the website.</p>
							<p>The website is provided as a general-purpose online utility. No account or subscription is currently required to use the core calculator.</p>
							<p>The information produced by this website is for general informational use and should not be treated as professional, legal, medical, financial, religious or other specialist advice.</p>

							<div class="policy-callout terms-callout">
								<div class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
										<path d="M12 8v4"></path>
										<path d="M12 16h.01"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
								<div>
									<strong>Important</strong>
									<p>
										The information produced by this website is for general
										informational use and should not be treated as professional,
										legal, medical, financial, religious or other specialist advice.
									</p>
								</div>
							</div>
						</section>

						<section id="calculator" class="policy-block reveal">
							<div class="section-head">
								<span class="section-number">02</span>
								<div class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 7h8"></path><path d="M8 11h2"></path><path d="M14 11h2"></path><path d="M8 15h2"></path><path d="M14 15h2"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>

							<h2>Age calculator results</h2>
							<p>The calculator determines age by comparing the birth date you enter with the current date available to your browser. It is designed to account for ordinary differences in month lengths and leap years when presenting completed years, months and days.</p>
							<p>Results can be affected by the accuracy of the date you enter, the date and time settings on your device, browser behaviour, and software limitations. You are responsible for checking a result before relying on it for any official or consequential purpose.</p>
							<p>For legal eligibility, identity verification, employment, education, immigration, insurance, benefits, medical care, or other formal decisions, use the method and documentation required by the relevant authority rather than relying solely on this tool.</p>

							<div class="info-strip">
								<div>
									<span>Designed for</span>
									<strong>Everyday age calculations</strong>
								</div>
								<div>
									<span>Official decisions</span>
									<strong>Verify independently</strong>
								</div>
								<div>
									<span>Accuracy depends on</span>
									<strong>Your date and device settings</strong>
								</div>
							</div>
						</section>

						<section id="calendar" class="policy-block reveal">
							<div class="section-head">
								<span class="section-number">03</span>
								<div class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 3v4"></path><path d="M8 3v4"></path><path d="M3 11h18"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>

							<h2>Hijri and calendar conversions</h2>
							<p>The site can present a Hijri birth date using calendar functionality available in the visitor's browser. Calendar conversions may differ from dates used by a particular country, community, mosque, authority, printed calendar, or observation method.</p>
							<p>The Islamic calendar can be determined through calculated systems, local conventions, or lunar observation. For religious observance or an official date, consult the calendar or authority you normally follow.</p>

							<div class="policy-callout">
								<div class="callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path d="M20.4 14.6A8.7 8.7 0 0 1 9.4 3.6 8.7 8.7 0 1 0 20.4 14.6Z"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
								<div>
