							</div>
						</section>

						<section id="zodiac" class="policy-block reveal">
							<div class="section-head">
								<span class="section-number">04</span>
								<div class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
										<path d="M12 3 14.6 8.4 20.5 9.2 16.2 13.3 17.3 19.2 12 16.4 6.7 19.2 7.8 13.3 3.5 9.2 9.4 8.4Z"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>

							<h2>Western and Chinese zodiac information</h2>
							<p>Western star signs, Chinese zodiac animals, elements, and personality descriptions are included as cultural and entertainment-oriented information. Personality descriptions are general traditional associations and are not scientific assessments of an individual.</p>
							<p>The Chinese zodiac year is determined using the browser's Chinese calendar support where available, which helps account for the fact that the Chinese zodiac year does not begin on January 1.</p>
							<p>The optional “Are you Muslim?” setting changes presentation for a specific Chinese zodiac result. It does not change the underlying year or element calculation.</p>

							<div class="future-card terms-context-card">
								<span class="future-status">Traditional information</span>
								<strong>Zodiac traits are cultural associations, not scientific assessments.</strong>
								<p>
