										<path d="M4 18V10"></path><path d="M10 18V6"></path><path d="M16 18V13"></path><path d="M22 18V3"></path>
									</svg>
								</div>
							</div>

							<h2>Lifetime statistics and estimates</h2>
							<p>Values such as total days, hours, minutes and seconds are mathematical time calculations based on the selected date and the current time. Other features, including estimated heartbeats, breaths and sleep time, use broad assumptions for illustrative and entertainment purposes.</p>
							<p>Those estimates are not measurements of your body, health, sleep or medical history and should not be interpreted as medical information.</p>

							<div class="info-strip">
								<div>
									<span>Elapsed time</span>
									<strong>Mathematical calculation</strong>
								</div>
								<div>
									<span>Heartbeats & breaths</span>
									<strong>Broad estimates</strong>
								</div>
								<div>
									<span>Medical use</span>
									<strong>Not intended</strong>
								</div>
							</div>
						</section>

						<section id="downloads" class="policy-block reveal">
							<div class="section-head">
								<span class="section-number">06</span>
