							<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
							<p>You may use the website for lawful personal and ordinary informational purposes. You must not intentionally misuse the site, interfere with its operation, attempt to bypass security measures, or use automated activity in a way that materially disrupts the service for others.</p>
							<p>You must not present calculator outputs as forged official records or use the site to facilitate fraud, impersonation, or other unlawful conduct.</p>

